# Windows release-time configuration for installer/build_installer.py
# Copy to .env.release locally when you want the installer script to inject
# release-only values without touching the bundled runtime env assets.
#
# Precedence for installer/build_installer.py:
# 1. Process environment
# 2. COLMEIA_RELEASE_ENV_FILE (optional explicit file override)
# 3. .env.release
# 4. .env (legacy fallback)
#
# Official production feed for GitHub Releases:
AUTO_UPDATE_FEED_URL=https://raw.githubusercontent.com/cesar-carlos/colmeia/main/appcast.xml
